  "statement": "Find the value of\n\n\\[\\binom{6}{1} 2^{1}+\\binom{6}{2} 2^{2}+\\binom{6}{3} 2^{3}+\\binom{6}{4} 2^{4}+\\binom{6}{5} 2^{5}+\\binom{6}{6} 2^{6} .\\]",
  "answerChoices": [],
